WEBVTT

00:10.420 --> 00:11.880
You son of a...!

00:20.960 --> 00:22.380
Why you...!

00:25.960 --> 00:28.080
Now you're gettin' it!

00:41.880 --> 00:44.170
R-run for it!

01:04.960 --> 01:07.670
N-no way...

01:09.330 --> 01:11.670
[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]

01:11.830 --> 01:12.750
[Good Luck]

01:24.210 --> 01:26.670
Holed up in my room invincible on Monday

01:26.670 --> 01:29.130
Take one step out and everything's a drag

01:29.250 --> 01:31.670
They're drawn to a flame shouting mayday

01:31.670 --> 01:33.750
I wanna pretend I didn't hear them

01:34.250 --> 01:35.580
Give up on the fair fights

01:36.380 --> 01:38.380
First come first served is an illusion

01:38.920 --> 01:40.710
Leave it all to the dice

01:41.210 --> 01:43.830
But make sure to roll them well

01:44.290 --> 01:46.580
Look, the stuff left behind after splitting things up

01:46.580 --> 01:49.170
Sometimes it's not all that bad y'know

01:49.170 --> 01:51.790
The stuff they have and I don't

01:51.790 --> 01:55.000
Nonsense, I won't be asking for it

01:55.750 --> 01:58.830
Alone & bad I'm doing great

01:58.830 --> 02:01.500
Wait now boy, you free?

02:01.580 --> 02:03.630
Hate grouping up?

02:03.830 --> 02:06.750
If you're bored, wanna try your luck?

02:06.880 --> 02:09.290
Botch & luck handle it and dance

02:09.290 --> 02:11.880
Down & fall is not my style

02:12.040 --> 02:14.500
Good Luck lies in odd numbers

02:14.500 --> 02:17.040
Isn't cheating a skill of its own?

02:27.750 --> 02:30.250
[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]

02:30.330 --> 02:32.670
[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]

02:32.790 --> 02:35.250
[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]

02:35.330 --> 02:36.080
[Good Luck]

02:39.670 --> 02:43.460
Stop! I don't wanna go to Omui!

02:43.540 --> 02:45.540
I'm going back to the woods!

02:44.130 --> 02:47.830
<b>Alone Again</b>

02:45.670 --> 02:49.130
G-goodness! Must you truly make such a fuss?

02:50.080 --> 02:52.130
Pulling a pouty face isn't fair!

02:54.130 --> 02:57.750
How am I supposed to say no now?!

02:58.790 --> 03:00.960
S-so this is the Lord's manor?

03:01.790 --> 03:03.750
It's so huge it's making me nervous!

03:04.460 --> 03:06.790
Is this the Lord of Omui and his wife?

03:06.790 --> 03:09.000
Glad they look happy and all, but...

03:10.960 --> 03:12.130
I think I'll just leave.

03:13.170 --> 03:15.290
And just why are you heading out?

03:15.580 --> 03:18.630
I asked you to wait while I got changed!

03:20.040 --> 03:23.380
I just... thought I'd wait outside?

03:23.500 --> 03:25.880
And leave while you were at it, I assume?

03:26.040 --> 03:29.130
Leave? Would I do that?

03:29.540 --> 03:33.920
I'm going to see you are well rewarded,
so please just stay right there!

03:34.130 --> 03:34.880
<b>GRRR!</b>

03:34.130 --> 03:34.880
<b>GRRR!</b>

03:34.130 --> 03:34.880
<b>GRRR!</b>

03:34.130 --> 03:34.880
<b>GRRR!</b>

03:38.210 --> 03:39.920
Wow!

03:40.710 --> 03:45.580
I invited you here to thank you for saving me
from those bandits...

03:47.000 --> 03:50.670
So why can I hardly contain this anger now?

03:50.670 --> 03:53.250
Delish! This is so good!

03:56.790 --> 03:57.710
Ahem!

04:00.540 --> 04:03.040
Your reward, though it hardly suffices.

04:03.290 --> 04:05.170
Huh? Money, too?

04:05.170 --> 04:06.920
Take it, if you would.

04:07.330 --> 04:10.920
And since you spoke of not possessing a form of ID...

04:11.630 --> 04:13.290
I would like you to have this.

04:13.880 --> 04:16.040
Whoa! Is that my name?

04:16.040 --> 04:19.790
Yes! Alongside the name of our town of Omui!

04:19.790 --> 04:20.920
Awesome!

04:20.920 --> 04:23.710
With it you will be allowed to come and go
from town as you please.

04:23.710 --> 04:24.750
It's so cool!

04:24.750 --> 04:29.040
It will also act as proof of your person. I hope
you'll use this chance to remember our town's name!

04:29.330 --> 04:30.080
Whoa!

04:30.250 --> 04:32.040
This dessert looks good, too!

04:32.330 --> 04:36.500
Ngh... Will you never listen to me?

04:36.500 --> 04:38.790
Yum! I knew it!

04:39.000 --> 04:42.580
Even after I got all dressed up for you...

04:43.830 --> 04:47.330
<b>DAY 22</b>

04:45.500 --> 04:47.580
Like I said...

04:47.710 --> 04:50.880
I was invited to the Lord's manor yesterday.

04:51.210 --> 04:53.960
I wasn't sneaking out of town or anything.

04:54.250 --> 04:56.040
That much I already know.

04:56.040 --> 05:00.170
But why? What did you do to get invited there?

05:00.170 --> 05:02.920
D-don't ask me...

05:03.540 --> 05:05.670
Come on, isn't that enough?

05:05.670 --> 05:06.880
Let's go do our quest!

05:07.420 --> 05:09.170
'Kay! See ya!

05:09.580 --> 05:13.670
Listen, Haruka! You aren't allowed to leave town!

05:14.130 --> 05:16.540
Okay! Got it!

05:16.960 --> 05:18.750
Magic crystals! Magic crystals!

05:18.750 --> 05:20.630
Sell 'em! Sell 'em!

05:20.630 --> 05:22.080
Shopping time!

05:28.460 --> 05:29.790
And now they're gone!

05:31.250 --> 05:35.000
Now there are no obstacles stopping me
from leaving town.

05:35.460 --> 05:37.210
Because now I've got...

05:37.460 --> 05:40.080
<b>TA-DAAA!!</b>

05:37.460 --> 05:40.080
<b>Haruka got ID!</b>

05:40.080 --> 05:42.460
Time to go it alone again!

05:43.250 --> 05:44.580
But before I do...

05:44.880 --> 05:48.040
I should buy stuff with the money I got
from uhh... Merry Mary?

05:48.290 --> 05:50.790
Eat all the non-mushroom food there is.

05:51.630 --> 05:53.920
And leave a note for the class rep.

05:54.500 --> 05:56.580
Something she won't get mad about.

05:57.000 --> 06:01.000
<b>GONNA GO</b>

05:57.000 --> 06:01.000
<b>CHECK ON THE JOCKS.</b>

05:57.000 --> 06:01.000
<b>LEVEL UP</b>

05:57.000 --> 06:01.000
<b>AND WAIT FOR ME.</b>

05:57.000 --> 06:01.000
<b>-HARUKA</b>

05:57.290 --> 06:00.830
I am actually worried about the dumb jocks.

06:12.710 --> 06:14.710
Back to the woods at last!

06:14.920 --> 06:17.540
If any carriages are under attack, I'm not looking!

06:29.630 --> 06:31.880
Back to the same old mushrooms.

06:34.380 --> 06:36.960
And fish in the river.

06:38.960 --> 06:40.710
The gobs and kobs, too.

06:41.170 --> 06:43.460
Mhmm, this is my forest.

06:50.080 --> 06:52.170
I'm back in my place.

06:57.670 --> 07:00.250
Man, can't wait to get back home!

07:06.670 --> 07:08.920
An orc? That's weird...

07:09.210 --> 07:11.670
They're usually deeper in the woods.

07:13.130 --> 07:15.130
Still, piece of cake!

07:15.500 --> 07:18.880
This stuff I bought from that sketchy vendor works great.

07:20.080 --> 07:22.670
<b>EQUIPMENT LIST</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:22.670
<b>Invisibility Cloak</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:22.670
<b>[MAKES WEARER HARDER TO DETECT]</b>

07:20.090 --> 07:22.670
<b>Mirror Cloak</b>

07:20.090 --> 07:22.670
<b>[REFLECTS MAGIC]</b>

07:20.090 --> 07:22.670
<b>MINOR MAGIC REFLECT</b>

07:20.090 --> 07:22.670
<b>Power Glove</b>

07:20.540 --> 07:22.880
With this many items combined,

07:22.670 --> 07:24.750
<b>Fire Staff</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:24.750
<b>[FIRE MAGIC]</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:24.750
<b>Cut-proof Clothing</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:24.750
<b>[CLOTHING THAT CANNOT BE CUT]</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:24.750
<b>Magic Blade</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:24.750
<b>[BLADE THAT GROWS SHARPER WITH MAGIC]</b>

07:22.670 --> 07:24.750
<b>REQUIRED LV: 50</b>

07:23.000 --> 07:24.960
life in the woods should be easy.

07:24.750 --> 07:26.080
<b>Evade Cloak</b>

07:24.750 --> 07:26.080
<b>SLIGHT BOOST TO EVASION</b>

07:24.750 --> 07:26.080
<b>Spacial Staff</b>

07:24.750 --> 07:26.080
<b>[GRANTS GREAT BOOSTS TO USERS OF SPACIAL MAGIC]</b>

07:29.670 --> 07:31.920
Still, something's up...

07:34.670 --> 07:36.330
What's happening here?

07:39.830 --> 07:41.000
Bloodstains?

07:42.000 --> 07:46.130
It can't be from the nerds, right? They're isekai pros.

07:47.170 --> 07:51.750
Must be the jocks, then.
Haven't seen them since we split.

07:53.000 --> 07:56.880
And why haven't the delinquents left the woods yet?

07:57.670 --> 07:58.880
<b>ENEMY DETECTION</b>

08:01.670 --> 08:03.170
That's a lot of blood...

08:04.080 --> 08:08.420
Those dumb jocks said they
were protecting the girls from the delinquents.

08:10.000 --> 08:12.670
Did they face off with them?!

08:13.540 --> 08:15.500
They really ARE dumb!

08:28.790 --> 08:30.170
You idiots...

08:33.420 --> 08:34.630
They're still breathing!

08:38.040 --> 08:40.580
Time to use every mushroom potion I made!

08:41.830 --> 08:43.210
Don't you quit on me!

08:44.000 --> 08:46.170
What are you good for if not toughing it out?!

08:54.630 --> 08:58.040
Oh, Haruka... You good?

09:00.540 --> 09:03.000
Oughta worry about yourself.

09:04.330 --> 09:06.580
Think we screwed up a bit...

09:07.080 --> 09:08.790
The girls safe?

09:09.080 --> 09:11.750
Yep. Laughing it up in town.

09:12.210 --> 09:13.500
All thanks to you.

09:13.710 --> 09:14.920
Yeah?

09:15.170 --> 09:19.750
Think what we did helped the class?

09:20.710 --> 09:24.670
Yeah. You're the best dumb jocks we've got.

09:27.500 --> 09:30.580
Yeah? Does that mean he...?

09:30.920 --> 09:35.130
Yep. The delinquents are dead. It all happened so fast.

09:35.630 --> 09:37.080
Are the nerds safe?

09:37.750 --> 09:40.710
No clue. Don't think they were attacked, but...

09:41.460 --> 09:42.290
All right...

09:42.460 --> 09:44.580
He's tough, though!

09:44.960 --> 09:47.500
We couldn't even hold even against him.

09:48.420 --> 09:51.710
He stole all the weapons we got in that white room, too.

09:52.380 --> 09:54.500
He's a mathematical genius.

09:54.830 --> 09:57.580
Might have been planning this all along.

09:58.210 --> 10:01.830
But we know who he's after next.

10:04.580 --> 10:05.420
Who?

10:06.080 --> 10:07.130
The class rep.

10:08.830 --> 10:12.170
She's the one with the Hijack skill, right?

10:14.580 --> 10:18.540
<b>SKILLS</b>

10:14.580 --> 10:18.540
<b>HIJACK</b>

10:14.590 --> 10:18.540
<b>CALISTHENICS</b>

10:14.960 --> 10:17.380
Hijack allows the user to steal someone's skills

10:17.380 --> 10:18.540
by killing them.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.670
It's a wicked OP skill.

10:22.040 --> 10:26.670
Me and the nerds should be the only ones
who know she has it, though.

10:28.750 --> 10:30.710
You guys figured it out?

10:31.500 --> 10:35.250
Only 'cuz he kept asking where she was.

10:35.540 --> 10:38.170
Must have gotten that intel somewhere.

10:41.500 --> 10:44.170
But he lost track of her.

10:44.880 --> 10:46.290
That's why he hit us...

10:46.710 --> 10:49.460
...but stopped shy of finishing us.

10:50.670 --> 10:55.580
Figured you'd seek her out for help, huh?

10:55.920 --> 11:02.130
Yep. So we thought we'd turn the tables
and came here instead.

11:02.750 --> 11:06.420
He's gonna follow our blood trail and show up here.

11:07.420 --> 11:10.750
If we fight him with you, we can win!

11:11.170 --> 11:13.630
I don't need to involve myself in this fight.

11:14.170 --> 11:16.380
All I want to do is live in peace here.

11:16.670 --> 11:18.380
I just wanna be alone!

11:19.460 --> 11:20.330
But...

11:23.380 --> 11:24.210
Fine.

11:24.960 --> 11:25.670
Haruka!

11:25.670 --> 11:26.420
All right!

11:26.420 --> 11:27.080
Atta boy!

11:27.080 --> 11:27.790
Let's do this!

11:30.920 --> 11:32.330
I'm gonna fight alone.

11:32.830 --> 11:33.540
What?!

11:33.540 --> 11:35.210
We can fight, too!

11:35.210 --> 11:37.000
You can't take him alone!

11:37.000 --> 11:38.710
You're kidding, right?

11:50.420 --> 11:52.710
Fine. You got it.

11:53.710 --> 11:55.830
I take it you have a plan?

11:56.670 --> 12:03.000
Yep. Your job is to head for town and apologize
to our class rep for being so dumb.

12:03.540 --> 12:04.790
The hell?!

12:05.040 --> 12:07.630
Go on now, get! Shoo!

12:12.540 --> 12:14.880
Haruka, the rest is up to you.

12:18.630 --> 12:22.500
Mighta been better to have them around...

12:24.040 --> 12:26.170
But if all of us go down...

12:28.710 --> 12:31.290
...there won't be anyone left to protect the girls.

12:32.250 --> 12:35.500
Fighting this guy is my job alone.

12:37.420 --> 12:40.710
Time to toughen up with what time I've got left!

12:42.170 --> 12:45.130
Haruka! Haruka!

12:46.420 --> 12:47.290
Find him?

12:47.290 --> 12:48.580
Nope, no sign.

12:48.580 --> 12:50.210
Same here.

12:50.500 --> 12:52.630
I'm sure he'll be back.

12:52.830 --> 12:54.500
He even left a note, right?

12:55.000 --> 12:55.540
Yeah...

12:55.750 --> 12:57.500
Nothing to worry about, then!

12:57.710 --> 13:01.540
All we can do is wait and level up.

13:01.540 --> 13:02.420
Yup.

13:07.580 --> 13:12.460
The jocks told me all about his OP weapon skill.

13:13.710 --> 13:16.420
Weapon skills are powerful.

13:17.080 --> 13:22.580
But once they start they leave you open
'cause you can't cancel out of them.

13:23.960 --> 13:29.960
If I want to beat him, I need to come up
with a new skill that'll take advantage of that weakness.

13:32.920 --> 13:34.960
Drawn to the smell of blood, huh?

13:35.710 --> 13:38.580
Monsters as tough as these
are usually deeper in the woods.

13:38.750 --> 13:39.830
<b>APPRAISAL</b>

13:39.830 --> 13:40.670
<b>GOBLIN</b>

13:39.830 --> 13:40.670
<b>GOBLIN</b>

13:39.840 --> 13:40.670
<b>GOBLIN</b>

13:39.840 --> 13:40.670
<b>GOBLIN</b>

13:40.670 --> 13:42.330
They're pretty high level...

13:42.790 --> 13:44.040
But so be it!

13:44.420 --> 13:45.420
Smash!

13:46.580 --> 13:47.420
Swing!

13:48.670 --> 13:49.420
Jab!

13:52.500 --> 13:56.790
Still no level up. Wish I could fight something stronger...

13:58.000 --> 13:59.330
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

14:01.790 --> 14:02.460
<b>GOBLIN KING</b>

14:02.580 --> 14:04.540
N-now even these things show up?

14:05.380 --> 14:07.460
Perfect timing, though!

14:08.830 --> 14:09.580
It's fast!

14:10.670 --> 14:12.580
It's not gonna swing that club?

14:17.130 --> 14:21.250
<b>Evade</b>

14:17.130 --> 14:21.250
<b>Cloak</b>

14:17.710 --> 14:20.500
If I hadn't combined this with an Evade Cloak
that woulda been bad.

14:23.830 --> 14:26.710
No doubt about it.
This thing's got powerful weapon skills.

14:27.210 --> 14:28.920
I can only barely evade them.

14:28.920 --> 14:30.880
But if I fight back, I'm done for!

14:35.420 --> 14:37.130
The perfect foe!

14:37.580 --> 14:38.920
Time to try something!

14:40.460 --> 14:43.000
<b>PACKING</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:43.000
<b>QUICK THINKING</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:43.000
<b>APPRAISAL</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:43.000
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:43.000
<b>STEALTH</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:43.000
<b>SERIAL THINKING</b>

14:40.460 --> 14:43.000
<b>SENSITIVITY</b>

14:40.470 --> 14:43.000
<b>PARALLEL THINKING</b>

14:40.470 --> 14:43.000
<b>WALKING</b>

14:40.470 --> 14:43.000
<b>CONCENTRATION</b>

14:40.470 --> 14:43.000
<b>DASH</b>

14:40.540 --> 14:41.880
Using Magic Wrap...

14:43.210 --> 14:45.330
And combining a bunch of skills together...

14:53.500 --> 14:54.960
For one quick swoop!

14:59.540 --> 15:01.790
It worked! That's what I'm talking 'bout!

15:02.420 --> 15:07.540
Even with the absolute worst skills,
once you combine them, you get something new!

15:11.790 --> 15:14.170
That's how I've always got by!

15:14.960 --> 15:16.460
<b>BLOOD-LUST</b>

15:17.330 --> 15:18.290
Where'd that come from?!

15:18.460 --> 15:21.920
<b>GOBLIN EMPEROR</b>

15:20.290 --> 15:21.920
Level 50?!

15:22.000 --> 15:23.330
I'm only Level 9!

15:23.330 --> 15:25.580
I can't win head-on against this thing!

15:26.210 --> 15:29.080
No choice but to try that again...

15:29.210 --> 15:31.080
<b>Stealth</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:31.080
<b>Movement</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:31.080
<b>Well-being</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:31.080
<b>Serial Thinking</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:31.080
<b>Calisthenics</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:31.080
<b>Clairvoyance</b>

15:29.210 --> 15:31.080
<b>Enemy Detection</b>

15:29.220 --> 15:31.080
<b>Packing</b>

15:29.330 --> 15:33.130
Mixing all my bad skills up into a new made-up one.

15:33.330 --> 15:37.210
<b>MADE-UP</b>

15:33.750 --> 15:36.710
Looks like I can learn skills I make myself.

15:38.460 --> 15:40.210
Time to bet it all on this!

15:42.210 --> 15:45.540
Gotta hit it lightning-fast as soon as I make my move!

15:55.580 --> 15:56.960
Definitely felt like a hit...

16:03.880 --> 16:05.750
But that didn't do a thing?

16:13.750 --> 16:14.920
It's way too fast!

16:17.630 --> 16:20.080
This thing's using weapon skills, too!

16:20.460 --> 16:21.880
I can't drop my guard for a second!

16:23.710 --> 16:25.170
Gotta find an opening!

16:27.540 --> 16:29.380
All right, that did some damage!

16:31.920 --> 16:32.920
Is it healing?!

16:37.830 --> 16:39.790
Time for another made-up skill, then!

16:53.830 --> 16:56.540
Not gonna lie, this is bad...

16:56.960 --> 16:59.460
But this is no time to wimp out.

17:00.580 --> 17:01.630
I mean...

17:07.170 --> 17:11.040
I'm not as beat up as the jocks were yet!

17:30.250 --> 17:33.000
HELL YEAH!

17:33.920 --> 17:37.630
Finally! Leveled up at last!

17:46.830 --> 17:51.170
Level 11. Got new skills just like I wanted, too.

17:51.670 --> 17:52.790
<b>Made-Up</b>

17:51.670 --> 17:52.790
<b>Magic Wrap</b>

17:51.670 --> 17:52.790
<b>Weight</b>

17:51.670 --> 17:52.790
<b>Packing</b>

17:53.330 --> 17:57.540
<b>MASTER OF NONE</b>

17:53.330 --> 17:57.540
<b>TAKES LONGER TO LEVEL UP,</b>

17:53.340 --> 17:57.540
<b>BUT MAKES IT EASIER TO ACQUIRE</b>

17:53.340 --> 17:57.540
<b>SKILLS AND RAISE THEIR LEVEL.</b>

17:53.500 --> 17:57.080
And now I finally get how Master of None works.

17:58.170 --> 18:03.290
<b>Well-being</b>

17:58.170 --> 18:03.290
<b>Sensitivity</b>

17:58.170 --> 18:03.290
<b>Dummy</b>

17:59.420 --> 18:02.580
Doubt I'm at level to match him yet...

18:03.790 --> 18:06.040
But I got the Skill I wanted.

18:07.000 --> 18:09.880
My Made-Up Skill handles the opening
left from using a weapon skill,

18:08.330 --> 18:10.630
<b>PACKING</b>

18:08.330 --> 18:10.630
<b>QUICK THINKING</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>APPRAISAL</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>STEALTH</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>SERIAL THINKING</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>SENSITIVITY</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>PARALLEL THINKING</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>WALKING</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>CONCENTRATION</b>

18:08.340 --> 18:10.630
<b>DASH</b>

18:10.630 --> 18:15.540
and let's me attack with no prep
as soon as I select the Skill.

18:18.380 --> 18:19.580
I have to do this.

18:20.630 --> 18:23.170
I'm gonna outdo those OP skills!

18:42.500 --> 18:43.500
Knew you'd show.

18:54.920 --> 18:56.080
Tanaka...

18:57.460 --> 18:58.670
Hey, Tanaka!

18:59.130 --> 19:02.580
This skill's gonna let us do as we please, yeah?

19:02.830 --> 19:04.170
I-I think so...

19:04.170 --> 19:05.710
Okay, Tanaka!

19:12.710 --> 19:14.420
I'm like, dead tired.

19:14.500 --> 19:17.000
It's all this leveling up.

19:17.130 --> 19:19.630
We're like legit adventurer's now!

19:19.630 --> 19:24.710
He seriously still not back, though?
Been two whole days.

19:24.960 --> 19:26.790
I'm kinda worried...

19:26.830 --> 19:30.170
We've gotta keep leveling even without him!

19:31.420 --> 19:33.710
Look. Someone's over there...

19:36.670 --> 19:37.960
Don't like the looks of 'em!

19:37.960 --> 19:39.500
Everyone get ready!

19:39.920 --> 19:41.920
Wait, Kakizaki?!

19:42.630 --> 19:43.580
Really?

19:43.580 --> 19:44.290
You're right!

19:44.290 --> 19:45.170
Long time no see.

19:45.170 --> 19:46.670
Glad you're okay!

19:47.830 --> 19:51.250
Wh-why are you all so beat up?

19:52.080 --> 19:53.830
We're fine.

19:54.880 --> 19:57.920
If you're here, does that mean Haruka is...

19:59.670 --> 20:01.210
He's not with you?

20:02.330 --> 20:07.290
Right now, he's out there fighting in the woods.

20:12.130 --> 20:13.330
All alone.

20:25.380 --> 20:27.500
Been a while, Tanaka.

20:28.420 --> 20:29.790
Welcome to my little place.

20:30.210 --> 20:36.290
Damn, here I was hoping the half-dead jocks
would lead me to the class rep.

20:37.420 --> 20:40.630
Never thought they'd come out to this creepy place.

20:41.170 --> 20:44.330
Yeah, sorry 'bout that.

20:45.830 --> 20:49.580
Kinda embarrassing getting duped
by some meatheads like this.

20:50.000 --> 20:54.920
After all that work I did to fake my way
with the delinquents and control them all.

20:55.880 --> 20:59.420
So you were planning this all from the start?

21:04.330 --> 21:05.630
Sure was.

21:05.880 --> 21:09.830
I was the one who used them to break the class up.

21:11.790 --> 21:15.920
What about the other guys?
Besides the delinquents and the jocks?!

21:16.420 --> 21:20.000
Do you have to ask? They're dead.

21:24.380 --> 21:30.290
Enough chit-chat. Gotta make my way
to where the Hijack skill is.

21:30.750 --> 21:34.920
No time to waste on a loser
with nothing but the worst skills.

21:41.920 --> 21:43.710
What are you trying to pull?

21:44.630 --> 21:47.710
Point that filthy stick somewhere else.

21:48.380 --> 21:49.540
I won't let you.

21:49.920 --> 21:51.540
What? Why?

21:51.540 --> 21:54.380
What's this got to do with a loner like you?

21:54.790 --> 21:58.420
Even loners have people they wanna keep safe!

22:00.130 --> 22:02.460
Yeah? All right...

22:03.790 --> 22:06.080
You get to die to me, too, then!

22:18.540 --> 22:22.880
The sunset I saw alone was beautiful

22:23.000 --> 22:28.330
Without telling anyone about it at all it's time for bed again

22:28.330 --> 22:32.580
Going on not worried about loneliness

22:32.580 --> 22:38.170
Encountering one new something after the next

22:38.170 --> 22:44.920
Been through a lot but it's unimaginable, isn't that funny?

22:45.460 --> 22:49.920
Might look indifferent but that's not always the case

22:50.040 --> 22:54.540
Never learning, carefree and doing as I please

22:54.920 --> 22:59.540
That's always the way it is, we're all our lone selves

22:59.670 --> 23:04.330
As we pass by we trade hellos and goodbyes

23:04.710 --> 23:09.380
Doesn't matter, just wanna enjoy today

23:09.380 --> 23:14.210
Have a bit of fun and then it's goodnight

23:14.710 --> 23:19.420
Sha-na-na-na-na, sha-na-na-na-na humming a tune

23:19.580 --> 23:23.630
Thinking about the day I see you again

23:24.540 --> 23:29.290
Sha-na-na-na-na, sha-na-na-na-na humming a tune

23:29.420 --> 23:33.210
In the middle of my journey alone
